- Cast to void* to avoid conversion errors on MinGW, which does not do the automatic conversion like msvc. r=bobowen, a=RyanVM\n\nMozReview-Commit-ID: 8fO9Nu9gaxh", "files": ["security/sandbox/chromium-shim/patches/with_update/mingw_noexports_casts.patch", "security/sandbox/chromium-shim/patches/with_update/patch_order.txt", "security/sandbox/chromium/sandbox/win/src/interception.h"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "15638bdb5acb23230520993618fe0d5f57f8f281", "parents": ["035ad5ecd97ee8a2e3beb9176e9d98d1163b1c75"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Tom Ritter \u003ctom@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1460882 - Disable SANDBOX_EXPORTS for the MinGW Build. r=bobowen, a=jcristau\n\nMozReview-Commit-ID: 2muTxIYUx6F", "files": ["security/sandbox/moz.build"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "9af1d77b0ec5d46be83c4afd4f30780a3f05f571", "parents": ["15638bdb5acb23230520993618fe0d5f57f8f281"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Tom Ritter \u003ctom@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1460357 - Do not use optimized AVX for Skia convolve_vertically in MinGW. r=lsalzman, a=jcristau\n\nMozReview-Commit-ID: 8ROpiDD4xYH", "files": ["gfx/skia/skia/src/opts/SkOpts_hsw.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "8d568f13019209d727e5ef0f777fe7d7ed27964b", "parents": ["9af1d77b0ec5d46be83c4afd4f30780a3f05f571"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Tom Ritter \u003ctom@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1460645 - Avoid the thread_local keyword for MinGW and instead use __thread. r=froydnj, a=jcristau\n\nMozReview-Commit-ID: 5RPwQVatThs", "files": ["mfbt/ThreadLocal.h"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "ccf77791ff9327b69643ece08e810f7162110180", "parents": ["8d568f13019209d727e5ef0f777fe7d7ed27964b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Tom Ritter \u003ctom@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1460647 - Move big-obj out of Developer_OPTIONS so local MinGW builds work. r=mshal, a=jcristau\n\n